  "description": "A lightweight .NET library for internal JWT authentication and claims handling, with refresh token rotation, password hashing, TOTP primitives, WebAuthn/FIDO2 second-factor and passkey sign-in verification, query-string tokens for WebSocket connections and path-scoped cookie tokens for files opened in a new tab",
  "iconFile": "BaseIcon.png",
  "id": "EasyReasy.Auth",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-17T08:04:31.94Z",
